  <step n="1" text="On GatewayRTRW two customer accounts exist: home1 and home2. Add the third, home0, with its own password."/>
  <step n="2" text="On each home router open the provider page and connect with that home's name and password."/>
  <step n="3" text="Try a wrong password on one home and read the refusal." check="c2"/>
  <step n="4" text="Look at the session list on the gateway: all three homes must be up." check="c1"/>
